   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adam Smith International is a global advisory company that works locally to
transform lives by making economies stronger, societies more stable, and
governments more effective.</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Som: Somaliland Security Programme SSP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SSP focused on strengthening security and justice institutions in Somaliland through the provision of expert advice, short term training, mentoring and limited material investment. The interventions were based on lessons learnt in previous Somaliland programming, global evidence on the effectiveness of Security and Justice (S&amp;J) interventions, and the local context in Somaliland.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Somaliland Security Programme (SSP) worked to improve the accountability and effectiveness of Somaliland&#x2019;s security architecture in delivering Somaliland&#x2019;s national security priorities. It bought together three funding streams (Conflict, Stability and Security Fund (CSSF), Counter Terrorism Programmes Fund (CTPF) and Foreign Commonwealth and Development Office (FCDO).</narrative>
  </description>
